  "solution": {
    "text": "$f(x)=\\frac{3 x-4}{2 x-3}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\nf(f(f(x))) & =f\\left(f\\left(\\frac{3 x-4}{2 x-3}\\right)\\right) \\\\\n& =f\\left(\\frac{3\\left(\\frac{3 x-4}{2 x-3}\\right)-4}{2\\left(\\frac{3 x-4}{2 x-3}\\right)-3}\\right)=f(x)\n\\end{aligned}$",
